 your troops and crafting clever strategies to outsmart the opposition. With every unit having a counter, it\u2019s up to you to tactically enlist the optimal units to defeat your enemies. Once the fight begins, use precise micro tactics to lead your chicken soldiers to triumph.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW YOUR FEATHERY LEGION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377710/extras/dc8e9b5e3b423623e78ee661e0c74e00.poster.avif?t=1747065209\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377710/extras/dc8e9b5e3b423623e78ee661e0c74e00.webm?t=1747065209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377710/extras/dc8e9b5e3b423623e78ee661e0c74e00.mp4?t=1747065209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each victory, you'll hatch stronger units and expand your coop to epic proportions. From noble chicken knights to beak-wielding kukri throwers, each new recruit will be cluckier and mightier than the last, building an unstoppable fowl force to conquer the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK EGG-CELLENT ENHANCEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377710/extras/e23ef6e71d00aa2ec1fbc4a122ac014d.poster.avif?t=1747065209\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377710/extras/e23ef6e71d00aa2ec1fbc4a122ac014d.webm?t=1747065209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377710/extras/e23ef6e71d00aa2ec1fbc4a122ac014d.mp4?t=1747065209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flock to the Tailsman Shop, where you can peck out upgrades to give your units a winning edge. Strap on Swift Spurs to your chicken-at-arms for extra speed, or arm your crossbowers with Toxic Eggs to poison enemies with every arrow. Get ready to ruffle some feathers and rule the roost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Soy Boy Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377710/header.jpg?t=1747065209","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3377710/799943/182f08b5bc8d9e70fd3708e723c2c34c00c21483/1750845412/dash_av1.mpd?t=1734393432","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3377710/799943/182f08b5bc8d9e70fd3708e723c2c34c00c21483/1750845412/dash_h264.mpd?t=1734393432","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3377710/799943/182f08b5bc8d9e70fd3708e723c2c34c00c21483/1750845412/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1734393432","id":257082037,"name":"Cluck and Conquer Alpha Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257082037/911ca0fe05242ee931c79c429cae277795df3844/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1734393432"}],"name":"Cluck and Conquer","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-9600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvid